@startuml

skinparam backgroundColor #f5f5f5
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #ffffff
  BorderColor #0b3c5d
  BorderThickness 1.5
  FontColor #0b3c5d
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
  StartColor #0b3c5d
  EndColor #0b3c5d
}

skinparam arrow {
  Color #0b3c5d
  FontColor #1e293b
  FontSize 11
  Thickness 1.5
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #fef3c7
  BorderColor #d97706
  FontColor #92400e
  FontSize 11
  BorderThickness 1
}


[*] -right-> Placed : customerPays()

state Placed {
  Placed : entry / startAcceptTimer(120s)
}

state Accepted {
  Accepted : entry / printKitchenTicket()
}

state Cancelled #fee2e2 {
  Cancelled : entry / logCancellation()
}

Placed -right-> Accepted : **acceptOrder()**\n**[restaurantOpen && capacityReady]** /\nnotifyCustomer("Order Accepted")

Placed -down-> Cancelled : **cancelOrder(reason)**\n**[elapsedTime <= 120s]** /\nprocessFullRefund(); notifyKitchen()

note on link
  <color:#0b3c5d>**UML Transition Equation:**</color>
  **Event [Guard] / Action**
  • **Event:** cancelOrder(reason) (Stimulus)
  • **[Guard]:** [elapsedTime <= 120s] (Boolean Gate)
  • **/ Action:** processFullRefund() (Atomic Effect)
end note

Cancelled -right-> [*]
@enduml
